---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ERP for Technology Companies | Ecosoft"
  description="Ecosoft implements ERPNext for tech startups and software companies — project management, subscription billing, procurement, and Thai accounting compliance."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Industry — Technology</p>
      <h1>ERP for tech companies that want a system as well-engineered as their product.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Technology companies need ERP systems they can trust, integrate, and extend — not black-box software that
        obscures what it's doing. Ecosoft implements ERPNext for Thai tech startups and scaleups, with the same
        open-source principles they apply to their own products.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Tech ERP Consultation</a>
        <a href="/case-studies/eos-orbit" class="btn btn-outline">See EOS Orbit Case Study</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- REFERENCE CLIENT -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-study-featured">
        <div>
          <span class="tag">ERPNext</span>
          <h2 style="margin-top:1rem;">EOS Orbit — Thailand's first satellite manufacturer</h2>
          <p>
            EOS Orbit needed ERP that could handle aerospace-grade engineering workflows, project-based production,
            multi-level BOMs for satellite components, and strict traceability requirements — while also managing
            Thai accounting compliance.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
            Ecosoft built a unified ERPNext system covering manufacturing, procurement, project management,
            quality control, and financial reporting. The CEO now has real-time visibility across all active
            satellite projects without waiting for manual reports.
          </p>
          <a href="/case-studies/eos-orbit" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Read the EOS Orbit case study</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
            <p>"ERPNext has become our core infrastructure. It enables rapid decision-making that is critical for a space-tech startup."</p>
            <footer>— Supidit Boonnawattanam, CEO, EOS Orbit</footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT TECH COMPANIES NEED -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="text-align:center;">What tech companies need from ERP</h2>
      <div class="cards-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">🔌</div>
          <h4>API-first architecture</h4>
          <p>ERPNext exposes a comprehensive REST API — so your product team can integrate ERP data into your own tools and dashboards without manual exports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">📋</div>
          <h4>Project-based operations</h4>
          <p>Tech companies often work in projects — with billing, resource allocation, and costing all tied to project structure rather than departments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">🔓</div>
          <h4>Full source code access</h4>
          <p>Your engineering team can read, audit, and extend the ERP codebase. No black boxes. No vendor permission required to understand what the system is doing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card">
          <div class="info-card-icon">⚡</div>
          <h4>Fast iteration</h4>
          <p>Custom requirements implemented as proper Frappe apps — version-safe, documented, and owned by you. Not fragile hacks that break on every update.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Building a tech company in Thailand that needs proper ERP?</h2>
      <p>Talk to a consultant who has implemented ERP for space-tech companies — we understand complex requirements.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
